# This Vercel project is a redirect to the Render service, not a Next.js app.
#
# Without this, Vercel sees package.json, decides the repo is a Next.js project,
# builds it, and injects a `services`/`rewrites` block that shadows the redirect —
# which serves the app from a serverless filesystem that cannot hold SQLite.
#
# Uploading nothing but vercel.json keeps it a pure redirect project.
*
!vercel.json